@title EMC door: the strap fix with preview, and guidance for a wire across the hinge
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The analog transmitter -B1 stands on the inside of the door and the door is stated as not bonded. Check > EMC check lists EMC-12: the door carries a device and is not bonded (Preview: Bond the door to the frame with a short strap, Apply is one undo step) and the unshielded analog wire crosses the hinge (guidance and the shield fix). The pictures are the evidence.
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet-door.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc check
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
scroll 360 400 -250
wait 6
shot 00-scrolled
expect "EMC-12"
expect "hinge"
shot 01-findings
check_layout
expect "Preview: Bond the door to the frame with a short strap"
click_text "Preview: Bond the door to the frame with a short strap" #1
wait 10
expect "Preview on a copy of the project"
expect "Clears EMC-12"
shot 02-preview
check_layout
click_text "Apply (one undo step)" #1
wait 15
expect "Door stated as bonded"
expect_not "Preview on a copy of the project"
shot 03-applied
check_layout
